# The model runs on a Great Lakes GPU, reached over the tunnel.
#
#   cp .env.greatlakes .env
#
# Same port and same line as .env.caen, because from aider's side the two are
# the same thing: a model on another machine, arriving on 11435. What differs
# is what puts it there. bin/greatlakes start is the Great Lakes half; it takes
# a GPU from Slurm and tunnels it here. bin/ollama-tunnel start is the CAEN one.
#
# 11435, not 11434, so this can be up at the same time as an Ollama running on
# your own machine.
export OLLAMA_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:11435
